	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a team with the name "Development Team" for the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And I set the permissions for a team with the name "Development Team" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Update | true |
	| View   | true |
	And I attempt to unset the following permissions for a team with the name "Development Team" for a permissioned user as a non permissioned user
	| Update | true |
	| View   | true |
	And I update a team with the name "Development Team" to have the new name "Engineering Team" as a permissioned user
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team with the name "Engineering Team"
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki team with the name "Engineering Team" as a permissioned user

